{
    "word": "cyclotron",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "458a1bb0-402e-32d1-a069-cc79058637c7",
                "word": "cyclotron",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d13ae219-557a-4f9a-850d-108a7b41a8b4",
                        "entry_id": "458a1bb0-402e-32d1-a069-cc79058637c7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "cyclotrons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f5245d6c-9406-3b69-b2db-0b1ce5692717",
                        "entry_id": "458a1bb0-402e-32d1-a069-cc79058637c7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An early particle accelerator in which charged particles were generated at a central source and accelerated spirally outward through a fixed magnetic field and alternating electric fields."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "28d68ad9-09a5-4960-9163-93ef62922cfc",
                                "sense_id": "f5245d6c-9406-3b69-b2db-0b1ce5692717",
                                "text": "The two cyclotrons achieve their biological effects by focusing charged particles on the tumor. However, the mechanisms differ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "036ceec9-168b-4fff-a896-325d0b4d48b3",
                                "sense_id": "f5245d6c-9406-3b69-b2db-0b1ce5692717",
                                "text": "We do not examine the 6 hours surrounding perikron as the ion cyclotron waves in this region have already been extensively discussed [Leisner et al., 2006]. Perikron was close to 2100 on 24 December and the inbound pass cuts through the dayside magnetosphere."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c6eced9-ba25-4bed-a510-a95184b4c21e",
                        "source_entry_id": "458a1bb0-402e-32d1-a069-cc79058637c7",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5245d6c-9406-3b69-b2db-0b1ce5692717",
                        "source_sense_description": "particle accelerator",
                        "target_lang_word": "cyclotron",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cyclotron",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df4ff3d2-4dc3-30b6-9f75-cbe8694b0f8a",
                                        "entry_id": "4092d003-db9d-346a-b4f2-897b7fb3fe29",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accélérateur de particules dans lequel les particules chargées sont générées par une source au centre, décrivent une spirale au travers d’un champ magnétique et sont accélérées par un champ électrique alternatif."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99655081-ec97-4799-a765-be0659cf8d91",
                                                "sense_id": "df4ff3d2-4dc3-30b6-9f75-cbe8694b0f8a",
                                                "text": "Le tout descendit dans son gosier, en faisant le bruit d'un cyclotron en pleine vitesse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55bccff2-0ccc-4b54-8b84-eb86471dccf7",
                                                "sense_id": "df4ff3d2-4dc3-30b6-9f75-cbe8694b0f8a",
                                                "text": "Mais Joliot rêve aussi d’un cyclotron, un de ces accélérateurs circulaires de particules qu’a inventé Ernest Lawrence, à Berkeley, en Californie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a7d1487-4ecf-4d17-865b-c37c86564242",
                        "source_entry_id": "458a1bb0-402e-32d1-a069-cc79058637c7",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5245d6c-9406-3b69-b2db-0b1ce5692717",
                        "source_sense_description": "particle accelerator",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zyklotron",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
